title: "PQCMicro: Post-Quantum Cryptography Toolkit for Microcontrollers"
abstract: "A highly optimized, memory-safe, FreeRTOS-aware C++ library bringing NIST FIPS 203 (ML-KEM) and FIPS 204 (ML-DSA) Post-Quantum Cryptography to resource-constrained IoT devices like the ESP32 and STM32."
